// Applied to the Hall/WallFade CanvasGroup so the tunnel dissolves to transparency
// toward its far end. CanvasGroup custom shaders must read the composited result
// via hint_screen_texture (not TEXTURE) and discard pixels outside the group's
// coverage, or the whole bounding box renders as a white box. local_y is the
